# route: level=w3_l2_coop difficulty=expert players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=eggs:0,wipes:0,x2_gates:2,painting:26,min_checkpoints:3
# The Expert two-stream route of Crystal Grotto in co-op (designer DB3; P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S; recorded from
# closed-loop duo macros with a hurt-driven repair search, build/db3/bot_w3_l2_coop.gd). As on Beginner down to the
# lower gallery: the Shellback pincer, the line drive over the icy pool (gate 'drive'), the drum count-in for the floe
# bridge (gate 'floes'). There P1 bounces on the Raptor waiting on the rock before the first ice pit and P2 clubs it
# while it is dazed; both jump the pit while the Shellback walks away, hop over it on the ice and jump the second pit;
# at the foot of the crystal shaft the same for the second Raptor; up the shaft one slab apart; in the skylight cave
# P2 Shoulder-Hops off P1's head onto the crystal cache for Cave Painting 26 (not the warp) and both walk into the
# exit (the team exit). Some hurts, no egg. Nobody stands 243 ticks without input.
